go-to: round2_menu

The KPD now endorses Braun in the presidential election! We ask them to keep their support low-key, so as to not alienate the bourgeois voters. 

@round2_thalmann
view-if: spd_support_thalmann == 0 and linke_support_schwesig == 0
choose-if: linke_relation >= 50 and left_strength > reformist_strength 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if linke_relation < 50 : We do not have good enough relations with the Communists, so they are not even willing to accept our support. ?] [? if reformist_strength >= left_strength : The reformist faction is able to dissuade the party from supporting this bizarre arrangement. ?]
